                   <string>Fog distance factor:</string>
                  </property>
                 </widget>
                </item>
                <item row="5" column="1">
                 <widget class="MyLineEdit" name="logedit_volumetric_fog_distance_from_surface">
                  <property name="toolTip">
                   <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adjusts the density of fog based on  the  distance from the fractal surface. Higher values produces fog which reaches further from the fractal surface.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
                  </property>
                 </widget>
                </item>
                <item row="7" column="1">
                 <widget class="MyComboBox" name="comboBox_distance_fog_primitive">
                  <property name="toolTip">
                   <string>Selects the geometric primitive used to define the spatial boundaries of basic fog. The chosen shape (such as box, sphere, or other available primitives) determines where in the scene the basic fog effect will be applied, allowing for precise control over the fog’s location and extent.</string>
                  </property>
                  <item>
                   <property name="text">
                    <string>None</string>
                   </property>
                  </item>
                 </widget>
                </item>
                <item row="10" column="1">
                 <widget class="MyColorButton" name="colorButton_fog_color_3" native="true">
                  <property name="toolTip">
                   <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Color of fog which is used farther than distance #2&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
                  </property>
                  <property name="text" stdset="0">
                   <string>PushButton</string>
                  </property>
                 </widget>
                </item>
               </layout>
              </item>
             </layout>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item>
            <widget class="MyGroupBox" name="groupCheck_iteration_fog_enable">
             <property name="toolTip">
              <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fog density depends on fractal iteration count — denser near high-iteration regions. Receives and casts shadows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In the &lt;b&gt;Full OpenCL&lt;/b&gt; engine, toggling iteration fog is instant (runtime toggle). Use &lt;i&gt;Auto Detect&lt;/i&gt; or Render Settings → Auto Iteration Fog for one-click tuning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Example with lights:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;:/tooltips/tooltips_images/image - shader - iterfog - lights.jpeg&quot;/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
             </property>
             <property name="title">
              <string>Fog based on iteration co&amp;unt</string>
             </property>
             <property name="checkable">
              <bool>true</bool>
             </property>
             <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="verticalLayout_27">
              <property name="spacing">
               <number>2</number>
              </property>
              <property name="leftMargin">
               <number>2</number>
              </property>
              <property name="topMargin">
               <number>2</number>
              </property>
              <property name="rightMargin">
               <number>2</number>
              </property>
              <property name="bottomMargin">
               <number>2</number>
              </property>
              <item>
               <layout class="QGridLayout" name="gridLayout_8" columnstretch="0,0">
                <property name="spacing">
                 <number>2</number>
                </property>
                <item row="7" column="0">
                 <widget class="QLabel" name="label_86">
                  <property name="text">
                   <string>Color #3:</string>
                  </property>
                 </widget>
                </item>
                <item row="1" column="1">
                 <widget class="MyDoubleSpinBox" name="spinbox_iteration_fog_opacity_trim">
                  <property name="sizePolicy">
                   <sizepolicy hsizetype="Minimum" vsizetype="Maximum">
                    <horstretch>0</horstretch>
                    <verstretch>0</verstretch>
                   </sizepolicy>
                  </property>
                  <property name="toolTip">
                   <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;There is no fog in volume where iteration count is lower than this value. When this parameter is high then fog is only just by fractal surface.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table border="0" style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;" cellspacing="2" cellpadding="0"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;p&gt;trim = 4&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;p&gt;trim = 6&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;p&gt;trim = 8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=":/tooltips/tooltips_images/image - shader - iterfog - 4 - 16000.jpg"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=":/tooltips/tooltips_images/image - shader - iterfog - 6 - 30000.jpg"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=":/tooltips/tooltips_images/image - shader - iterfog - 8 - 40000.jpg"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
                  </property>
                  <property name="prefix">
                   <string></string>
                  </property>
                  <property name="suffix">
                   <string></string>
                  </property>
                  <property name="decimals">
                   <number>2</number>
                  </property>
                  <property name="maximum">
                   <double>1000.000000000000000</double>
                  </property>
                  <property name="singleStep">
                   <double>1.000000000000000</double>
                  </property>
                 </widget>
                </item>
                <item row="3" column="1">
                 <widget class="MyDoubleSpinBox" name="spinbox_iteration_fog_color_1_maxiter">
                  <property name="sizePolicy">
                   <sizepolicy hsizetype="Minimum" vsizetype="Maximum">
                    <horstretch>0</horstretch>
                    <verstretch>0</verstretch>
                   </sizepolicy>
                  </property>
                  <property name="toolTip">
